PN,35301
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FA man who falsely imprisoned and
OL,7,Fsexually assaulted a woman he was
OL,8,Fgiving a unlicensed lift to will be
OL,9,Freleased from Guernsey's mental health
OL,10,Ffacility.
OL,12,FWilliam King, 45, was arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of sexual assault in 2023,
OL,14,Fbut was found unfit to stand trial due
OL,15,Fto having an intellectual disability.
OL,17,FAlthough he could not be convicted or
OL,18,Fpunished, a court found that he had
OL,19,Fsexually assaulted a woman whilst
OL,20,Facting as an unlicensed taxi driver.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FInstead of prison, he was detained in
OL,7,Fthe island's only dedicated mental
OL,8,Fhealth facility, Les Oberlands, to
OL,9,Fundergo sexual offending treatment. He
OL,10,Fhas been there since January 2025.
OL,12,FKing is already under a Sexual
OL,13,FOffences Prevention Order (SOPO) which
OL,14,Flimits his actions and is designed to
OL,15,Fprotect the public - this will be
OL,16,Fupdated ahead of his release.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FKing has been held at His Majesty's
OL,7,FPleasure, which essentially means he
OL,8,Fis in the facility indefinitely,
OL,9,Falthough he has now completed the
OL,10,Fcourse.
OL,12,FPre and post-treatment scores suggest
OL,13,Fthat the programme did not make a
OL,14,Fsignificant difference and concerns
OL,15,Fwere raised by the prosecution about
OL,16,Fhis ability to keep to the SOPO
OL,17,Frequirements.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FHe has allegedly broken them twice
OL,7,Falready and the prosecution said he
OL,8,Fhad revealed intentions to break the
OL,9,Forder again.
OL,11,FThis included an incident where he
OL,12,Fwrote a letter to a female patient
OL,13,Fsuggesting they go for a drive in a
OL,14,Fcar, although the message was never
OL,15,Fdelivered.
OL,17,FKing has also turned down the
OL,18,Fopportunity of further therapy and
OL,19,Ftreatment.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FHe is deemed to be at high risk of
OL,7,Foffending on release, according to
OL,8,FGuernsey's Probation Service, who
OL,9,Frepeated again that they are not
OL,10,Fconvinced he will stick to any
OL,11,Frequirements.
OL,13,FDespite this, Defence Advocate Peter
OL,14,FFerbrache argued that King could not
OL,15,Fsimply be held at Les Oberlands
OL,16,Fforever.
OL,18,FThe court revisited King's application
OL,19,Fto be discharged, the process of which
OL,20,Fbegan in May.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FAt that time, the courts wanted more
OL,7,Fclarity on how his potential risk to
OL,8,Fthe public would be managed. They
OL,9,Fdelayed the decision until now when a
OL,10,Fclearer plan could be drawn up.
OL,12,FAdvocate Ferbrache said there would
OL,13,Fnever be "no risk" unless King was
OL,14,Fkept on the ward for the rest of his
OL,15,Flife, and that managing him at home
OL,16,Fwas the best option.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FCrown Advocate Liam Roffey disagreed,
OL,7,Fsaying that "the passage of time is
OL,8,Fnot a legitimate reason for release"
OL,9,Fand reminded the court of the Jurat's
OL,10,Ffindings in May.
OL,12,FThey determined that discharging King
OL,13,Fwould create an unacceptable risk to
OL,14,Fthe public, especially for young women.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FIn making their decision, the Jurats
OL,7,Fsaid via Judge Catherine Fooks that
OL,8,Faccepting his application did not mean
OL,9,Fthey did not think there was a risk to
OL,10,Fthe public, but that the plan and
OL,11,Fprotections in place would be enough
OL,12,Fto protect the community.
OL,14,FIt was also a 'decision in principle',
OL,15,Fwhich is dependent on the original
OL,16,FSOPO being amended.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785872169
OL,3,C'High-risk' man to be released from
OL,4,Cmental health facility
OL,6,FOnce drafted, King will be released
OL,7,Ffrom Les Oberlands in a staggered
OL,8,Fmanner, where he will gradually spend
OL,9,Fless time detained over four weeks
OL,10,Funtil he moves out permanently.
OL,12,FHe will also get weekly visits from a
OL,13,Fsupport worker.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G9/9
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
